{"speciesId":840,"names":{"fr":"Verpom","es":"Applin","en":"Applin","ja":"カジッチュ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il vit toujours dans sa pomme. S’il croise un Pokémon oiseau, son prédateur naturel, il se fait passer pour un simple fruit pour se protéger."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Habita durante toda su vida en el interior de una manzana. Finge ser una fruta para protegerse de los Pokémon pájaro, sus enemigos naturales."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It spends its entire life inside an apple. It hides from its natural enemies, bird Pokémon, by pretending it’s just an apple and nothing more."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"一生 りんごの 中で 暮らし 天敵の 鳥ポケモンに 出会うと りんごの 振りをして 身を守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"À la naissance, il s’installe dans une pomme et grandit en se nourrissant de sa chair. Son évolution dépend de la saveur du fruit."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Nada más nacer se refugia en una manzana, cuyo interior va devorando a medida que crece. El sabor de la fruta determina la evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"As soon as it’s born, it burrows into an apple. Not only does the apple serve as its food source, but the flavor of the fruit determines its evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"生まれると りんごに 潜りこむ。 中身を 食べながら 成長し りんごの 味が 進化を 決める。"}],"varieties":[{"id":840,"moves":[{"name":"withdraw","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"defense-curl","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"rollout","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"attract","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"recycle","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"astonish","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"sucker-punch","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"draco-meteor","learns":[[20,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"grassy-glide","learns":[[20,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tera-blast","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},